# The cells of all five scopes are handed back. The mark lies in the header, and while a cell waits the link to the next lies in the slot of its first variable: a scope is as large as its variables make it, 8 bytes of header and 8 a variable in steps of 16.
# f1 = each, f2 = one, f3 = two, f4 = three, f5 = four, f6 = five
# -- source: scopes-of-one-to-five-variables-have-no-room-for-the-mark.ts
